parate pairing-key handoff&lt;br&gt;Cloud Router ASN 16550 / BGP disabled until assigned values verified" style="html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;labelPosition=center;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;spacingTop=-2;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="n5"><mxGeometry x="665.00" y="475.00" width="70.00" height="70.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.gcp2.partner_interconnect;fillColor=#4285F4;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="n17" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0.00" y="0.00" width="70.00" height="70.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" value="Optional VPN: two CPE + IPSec connections&lt;br&gt;Four managed IKEv2 BGP tunnels after tunnel-ID discovery&lt;br&gt;GCP HA gateway public IPs are explicit CPE inputs&lt;br&gt;Separate protected PSKs / no automatic discovery or failover" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#759C6C;fontColor=#161513;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="n4"><mxGeometry x="100.00" y="810.00" width="1200.00" height="155.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value="Optional HA VPN gateway / two public interfaces&lt;br&gt;Four OCI endpoint mappings + IKEv2 tunnels&lt;br&gt;Independent VPN Cloud Router / ASN 64514 / BGP peers" style="html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;labelPosition=center;whiteSpace=nowrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;spacingTop=-2;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=2;" vertex="1" parent="n5"><mxGeometry x="665.00" y="850.00" width="70.00" height="70.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" value="" style="shape=mxgraph.gcp2.cloud_vpn;fillColor=#4285F4;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="n23" connectable="0"><mxGeometry x="0.00" y="0.00" width="70.00" height="70.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" value="DEFAULT RESULT: No cloud resources; cost and creation/workload flags false. Local metadata guards remain. Separate roots and credentials for each cloud.&lt;br&gt;Native detail pages enumerate every root/module/companion declaration, including private networking, flow logs, IAM and service-specific dependencies.&lt;br&gt;Existing projects/APIs, scoped credentials, region eligibility, quota, supported images/versions, address plans, routes and DNS are explicit prerequisites." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FCFBFA;strokeColor=#9E9892;fontColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;spacing=6;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20.00" y="1360.00" width="2940.00" height="160.00" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value="VCN attachment / configured peer subnet route" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n8" target="n6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value="VPC + Cloud Router association / BGP control plane" style="html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startFill=0;rounded=0;endSize=6;startSize=6;strokeColor=#312D2A;fontSize=10;fontColor=#312D2A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Oracle Sans,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;endArrow=none;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n17" target="n16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id=